        "texto": "This “pillow” (προσκεφύλαιον) is supposed by critics to have been different from the soft pillow used for a headrest in houses. See note on Ezekiel 13:18 (#573). Such an article would hardly be in place in a fisherman’s boat. It was rather the cushion or fleece on which the rower…",
